{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10136170","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10136170","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1013616001:":{"text":"デューラ様、星と月が沈み、日が昇る時。\nどうか我らの旅路をお守りください。\n共に戦う仲間たちをお守りください。","source_cn":"艾雅在上，当星月落尽朝阳升起，\n请保佑我们踏上坦途。\n请保佑与我并肩作战的同伴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF94A8FF23F342793","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1013616002:":{"text":"数年前、聖石を取り戻せなかった罪は……\nいかなる代償を払ってでも必ずや贖って――","source_cn":"时隔多年，那未能寻回圣石之罪，\n我将立誓偿还，不惜代价——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21BE0488CFEA1703","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013617001:2":{"text":"……どんな代償を払うつもりだ？","source_cn":"……你到底想付出什么代价？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF5F0F2E64EA5B26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1013617002:2":{"text":"なっ、これは夢？……アタランテ、なぜお前がここにいる？","source_cn":"我在做梦吗？阿塔兰忒，你为什么在这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2410D3F1B7DBD15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013617003:0":{"text":"アンタがアタシの夢を見るわけないだろ。正真正銘、本物だよ。","source_cn":"你才不会梦到我呢。我就在这里……实实在在的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53514862881AC376","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1013617004:0":{"text":"何度言えば分かるんだ？あれはアンタじゃなくてアタシの犯した罪だ。まあ、たとえもう一度選べと言われても、アタシは同じことをしたけどな。","source_cn":"还要我说多少次？当年的事，是我的罪，不是你的。但即使再...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC65B0E0A17DEF39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013617005:0":{"text":"まだあの時の真相を教えてはくれないのか？","source_cn":"你还是不打算告诉我当年的真相吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA363A79EB7C8693","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1013617006:0":{"text":"言いたくないって知ってるくせに、なんで聞くんだ？相変わらずデリカシーのない奴だなぁ。","source_cn":"明知道我不想说，你为何要问？我应该说过你，别这么不解风情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2662164C12B2675","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1013617007:0":{"text":"今はお前の冗談に付き合っている暇はない。","source_cn":"这不是开玩笑的时候，阿塔兰忒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CA1CB2184A2C7F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1013617008:0":{"text":"騎士になったあの日に、私はデューラ様に誓ったのだ。そして今までずっと、聖堂で最も厳格な戒律を守り続けている……","source_cn":"我从成为骑士的那天起，就立誓守护艾雅。时至今日，我践行...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE64E002FA0B28D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1013617009:0":{"text":"だがそれでも私が罪人である事実は変わらない。私は、この世で最も卑劣な悪徒と同じく……己の意志で女神様の恩情を裏切ったのだから……","source_cn":"但我仍是罪人。因为我的的确确，与世间最卑劣的恶徒一样…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF73E4CB6352A2857","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1013617010:0":{"text":"だが私は……お前を逃がしたことを後悔していない。","source_cn":"我放你离开了。但你知道的，我也不后悔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09B8C16CF0AE8DE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1013617011:0":{"text":"お前と同じだよ、たとえもう一度選べと言われても、私は同じことをしただろう。","source_cn":"我想说与你一样的话，即使再给我一次机会，我也会作出相同...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C6BF318F60BAA54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1013617012:0":{"text":"それでも……私は罪を償わなければならない。せめてこの償いが無駄にならないためにも、アタランテ、どうか教えてほしい……","source_cn":"但……我必须为此赎罪。为了让我的赎罪不至于毫无价值，阿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FA5AF3F4589434A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1013617013:0":{"text":"……だめだ、言えない。","source_cn":"……不，我不能说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39B617A67201DAC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docume